<title>SPAIN: Telefonica details 9-mth results by sector.</title>
<headline>Telefonica details 9-mth results by sector.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish telecommunications group Telefonica detailed the following results by business sector in billions of pesetas unless specified:</p>
<p>				  Jan-Sept 96   Jan-Sept 95   pct change</p>
<p> Basic telephony	     1,025.68	  905.65	 13.3</p>
<p> Intn'l communications	 105.76	  110.25	 -4.1</p>
<p> Public use telephony	   62.01	   60.20	  3.0</p>
<p> Data transmission		34.31	   30.03	  14.3</p>
<p> Mobile telephones	     178.76	   83.22	 114.8</p>
<p> Int'l business		  258.31	  223.45	  15.6</p>
<p> Publicity and info	     25.49	   16.14	  57.9</p>
<p> Multimedia			  1.67	    2.08	 -20.0</p>
<p> Other			    -194.22	 -106.57</p>
<p> Total group revenue	 1,497.77	1,324.44	  13.1</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
